Z||000000||WisconsinGT||02-23-2000||12:22 AM||||It is getting close to the summer season. So I am doing some work on my GT. One thing I am going to do is replace my trunk carpet. Anyone have any info. on how I can do this? i.e. What type of material can I use? How can I mold it like GM did? Can I clean my old one? If so how?||||reg||1
Z||000001||DXR_DAD||02-23-2000||12:47 AM||||The carpet on my 87 was trashed, bad smell too. I sprayed it with 409 carpet cleaner and then took it to the "you-spray-it" car wash hung it up and sprayed it off real good then let it dry (2 days) before install. It came out like new I mean clean!!, carpet fresh, vac. and it's good as new.||||reg||1
