Z||000003||fierodave||02-23-2000||05:35 AM||||automotive  wax & grease remover!!<BR> <BR>put it in a spray bottle!!!   <BR>soak it down real good!  <BR>then brush with stiff nylon cow brush!  <BR>hose off at the car wash,  <BR>then foam and brush it there too!  Rinse,  let dry,  the carpet material will shine like it did new from the factory!!!<BR>FD<p>[This message has been edited by fierodave (edited 02-23-2000).]||||reg||1
